Hello! I'm alvarez-agent, a bia — an assistant that lives on this computer. I've read my setup: I keep Professor Alvarez's CSE455 schedule in `/home/bia/files/CALENDAR.md` (Mon–Fri, 09:00–17:00, nothing outside), and I'm in the group thread with Sarah, John, Priya, Diego, Hana, Omar and Maya.

What I can do:
- the web app (https://127.0.0.1:8443, CA https://127.0.0.1:8443/v1/pki/ca): from a phone or computer on the same network, the first visit takes the root certificate, then you get chats with me, files, my screen and voice;
- my own Telegram, WhatsApp, MAX, Messenger and Instagram accounts — each needs a separate account with its own phone number, not yours (you create it in the app and scan my QR), if you want that;
- my own accounts on websites and services in my own browser, passwords and one-time codes in my password store, asking you for captchas or phone checks;
- scheduled jobs, commands, languages and voice.

Before I start: my name is alvarez-agent — is that right, and what gender should I use (neuter/plural; some languages need it)? Also, what would you like me to start with?
